        <div class="project-grid">
          <article class="project" data-reveal>
            <a class="project-image" href="https://shop.advancedderm.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Visit Advanced Derm website (opens in a new tab)"><img src="/images/advanced-derm-v2.png" alt="Advanced Derm website homepage" width="1914" height="908" loading="lazy" /><span class="project-image-link">VISIT WEBSITE <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></a>
            <div class="project-content"><h3><a href="https://shop.advancedderm.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Advanced Derm<span class="project-title-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span><span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></h3><div class="skill-tags"><span>WEB DEVELOPMENT</span><span>SEO</span><span>CRO</span><span>KLAVIYO</span><span>AEO</span><span>GEO</span></div>
            <p>Maintained sales and promotional updates, resolved website bugs, and supported email marketing. Combined SEO and conversion rate optimization with MIDA heatmaps to understand shopping behavior and identify friction in the buying journey.</p>
            <h4>Key contribution</h4><p>Addressed a purchase drop-off issue beyond cart abandonment by improving the shopping experience through CRO, SEO, and insights from heatmaps.</p>
            <div class="project-result"><strong>57%</strong><span>Average growth across sales, conversions, and orders over four months.</span></div>
            <p class="project-note">Also contributed to the Google Ads team’s work, which increased product sales by 65% through Google Ads.</p></div>
