            <div class="project-content"><h3><a href="https://thecloseoutconnection.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">The Closeout Connection<span class="project-title-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span><span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></h3><div class="skill-tags"><span>FULL-STACK DEVELOPMENT</span><span>TECHNICAL SEO</span><span>ON-PAGE SEO</span><span>OFF-PAGE SEO</span><span>AEO</span></div>
            <p>Worked as the full-stack developer, improving the site’s technical foundations alongside on-page and off-page SEO. Technical SEO work focused on loading performance, crawlability, indexing, URL structure, and consistent product information so search engines could access and understand the site.</p>
            <h4>Key contribution</h4><p>Helped resolve issues inherited from the previous shipping setup, making shipping information and checkout behavior more consistent. Supported fixes for product visibility issues that were preventing affected products from appearing properly on Google.</p>
            <div class="project-outcome"><span>THE IMPROVEMENT</span><p>A more reliable shipping experience and improved Google visibility for affected products, helping customers find products and move through checkout with less friction.</p></div></div>
          </article>
          <article class="project" data-reveal>
            <a class="project-image" href="https://biopelle.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Visit Biopelle website (opens in a new tab)"><img src="/images/biopelle.png" alt="Biopelle website homepage" width="1914" height="908" loading="lazy" /><span class="project-image-link">VISIT WEBSITE <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></a>
            <div class="project-content"><h3><a href="https://biopelle.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Biopelle<span class="project-title-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span><span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></h3><div class="skill-tags"><span>WEB DEVELOPMENT</span><span>PERFORMANCE</span><span>SEO PLANNING</span><span>AEO</span><span>GEO</span></div>
            <p>Supported Biopelle, a website within the same company group as Advanced Derm. Resolved technical and loading issues, upgraded website functionality, and helped put a planned SEO approach into practice.</p>
            <h4>Key contribution</h4><p>Connected technical maintenance with SEO planning: prioritizing issues that affected site access and usability, then organizing optimization work around page structure, content relevance, and search visibility.</p>
            <div class="project-outcome"><span>THE IMPROVEMENT</span><p>More dependable loading and functionality, a smoother browsing experience, and a clearer SEO foundation for ongoing optimization.</p></div></div>
          </article>
          <article class="project" data-reveal>
            <a class="project-image" href="https://linendipity.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Visit Linendipity website (opens in a new tab)"><img src="/images/linendipity.png" alt="Linendipity website homepage" width="1914" height="908" loading="lazy" /><span class="project-image-link">VISIT WEBSITE <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></a>
            <div class="project-content"><h3><a href="https://linendipity.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Linendipity<span class="project-title-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span><span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></h3><div class="skill-tags"><span>WOOCOMMERCE → SHOPIFY</span><span>WEB DEVELOPMENT</span><span>SEO FOUNDATIONS</span><span>AEO</span></div>
            <p>Migrated the existing website from WooCommerce to Shopify and supported development, with a primary focus on establishing the new store’s SEO foundations.</p>
            <h4>Key contribution</h4><p>Helped structure the Shopify store for search, with attention to page hierarchy, product and collection organization, metadata, and internal linking. Migration planning centered on maintaining discoverability as the site moved between platforms.</p>
            <div class="project-outcome"><span>THE IMPROVEMENT</span><p>A Shopify storefront with a more organized structure and a consistent SEO foundation, making future content updates and optimization easier to maintain.</p></div></div>
          </article>
